    "notes": "[Houzz #6164028] Due to ongoing mental health services at the facility, construction noise and disruption cannot occur during business hours. Reconstruction must therefore occur after hours and on weekends, resulting in labor premium costs and extended mobilization requirements.\n\n  \n\nOnce siding is removed, we expect to find additional damaged framing and wet materials. We will document and submit supplements as exposure continues.",
